    "updated_at": "2018-11-09T12:59:09Z",
    "body": "Unfortunately this is still a pretty big hole in `nonce` based CSP policies because it opens very simple avenues for injection points to become dangling-markup nonce-stealing attacks.\r\n\r\nDoes the above approach detailed by Mike seem reasonable. What are peoples thoughts?",
